sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as Main camera owner
    participant AR as ArCoreFrameProvider
    participant Vision as D05 recognition
    participant Depth as D07 pipeline
    participant Q as D02 feedback
    Main->>AR: F-D07-001 current Frame 획득
    AR-->>Main: camera Image와 owner epoch receipt
    Main->>Vision: 원본 RGB luma token 복사
    Main->>AR: Image close 후 receipt로 depth 요청
    AR->>AR: Raw pair 복사 close 후 선택적 Full
    AR-->>Main: frame CPU Image clocks와 owned snapshot
    Main->>Depth: source index와 current target evidence
    Depth->>Depth: P-D07-007 capture 검사 및 독립 Raw history
    alt 원본 source age 800ms 이내
        Depth-->>Main: risk 또는 UNKNOWN과 원본 lease
        Main->>Q: current owner와 receipt 확인 후 후보
    else stale 또는 capture 불일치
        Depth-->>Main: 빈 결과 또는 metric 권한 없음
    end
